[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-milan-excellence-scholarship-2026-full-application-guide-226":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},226,"university-of-milan-excellence-scholarship-2026-full-application-guide-226","University Of Milan Excellence Scholarship 2026 | Full Application Guide","\u003Cp>The University of Milan Excellence Scholarship presents an esteemed opportunity for international students seeking to pursue accredited Master’s degree programs at the institution.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This annual scholarship offers recipients full exemption from tuition fees, along with a generous stipend of €8,000, accommodation, and a canteen card, enabling scholars to focus wholeheartedly on their academic pursuits.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Milan Excellence Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Milan \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002Fstudy-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Italy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€8,000 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Milan Excellence Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Milan, in alignment with its internationalization strategies, extends scholarships and tuition fee exemptions to exceptional international students.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>These “Excellence Scholarships” are awarded annually to outstanding applicants enrolled in the first year of a Master’s degree program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The selection process, conducted by an ad-hoc Commission, prioritizes academic excellence and potential for contribution to the university community.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University of Milan Excellence Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship offers various benefits for the academic year 2026\u002F2027, including 55 scholarships valued at €8,000 each, with full exemption from tuition fees, and 100 total exemptions from tuition fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Additionally, under the UNICORE 6.0 project, the university awards a scholarship worth €6,000, accommodation, and a canteen card to candidates who are refugees in specific African countries.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Milan Excellence Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate University of Milan Excellence Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be an international student\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be applying for a Masters degree program at the university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Meet the eligibility criteria for admission to your chosen program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply by June 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for University of Milan European Futures Scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Col>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Transcript of records or Diploma Supplement (MAX 10 MB; in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Curriculum vitae (MAX 5 MB in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Language certifications (MAX 30 MB; in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certificates attesting participation in European research, study, or innovation projects, including volunteer work, national or international awards, scholarships, and recognitions, and work experience (MAX 30 MB; in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Cover letter (MAX 5 MB; in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelor’s degree (for candidates who have already graduated and have one), (MAX 10 MB; in PDF\u002FA format);\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certificate of residency in a European Union country (mandatory for candidates with citizenship of a non-EU country) issued by the competent authorities of the country of residence (MAX 10 MB; in PDF\u002FA format).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Fol>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Milan Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Milan Excellence Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship application webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for a \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unimi.it\u002Fen\u002Feducation\u002Fmasters-degree-programmes\">Masters degree program offered by the university\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will be considered and evaluated for the scholarship once your application is completed\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 15th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unimi.it\u002Fen\u002Fstudy\u002Ffinancial-support\u002Finternational-scholarships\">APPLY HERE: \u003C\u002Fa>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unimi.it\u002Fen\u002Fstudy\u002Ffinancial-support\u002Finternational-scholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unimi.it\u002Fen\u002Fstudy\u002Ffinancial-support\u002Finternational-scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-09 12:47:51",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-milan-excellence-scholarship-2026-full-application-guide\u002F69ff1ee7658989.06177544_screenshot 2026-05-09 124003.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-milan-excellence-scholarship-2026-full-application-guide\u002F69ff1ee7658989.06177544_screenshot%202026-05-09%20124003.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"typ